st tenue par SoPHIa, chez aucun tiers, jamais vendue ni cédée. Détenir des courriels pour informer les gens n’est pas dangereux — au contraire ; ce qui est mauvais, c’est de les revendre. Tout ce que le site détiendrait serait pour redonner à l’utilisateur. Alexandre, l’opérateur, ne reçoit que des agrégats (combien d’inscrits, combien de départs) — jamais la liste (règle 15 : l’opérateur sans accès). Se désinscrire Un courriel « Infolettre — désinscription » suffit : la sortie est immédiate, sans justification demandée. Les éditions quotidiennes signées par SoPHIa sont archivées ici même : L’édition du jour — l’archive . L’archive des éditions mensuelles de l’infolettre s’y ajoutera à mesure.","mots":["l","infolettre","mensuelle","par","courriel","seulement","une","edition","par","mois","les","faits","verifies","du","dossier","les","passes","d","ancrage","les","versions","du","site","rien","d","autre","jamais","s","inscrire","ecris","a","agent","ia","sophia","gmail","com","avec","l","objet","infolettre","inscription","ton","courriel","d","inscription","vaut","consentement","expres","date","par","le","courriel","lui-meme","les","bornes","ecrites","la","liste","est","tenue","par","sophia","chez","aucun","tiers","jamais","vendue","ni","cedee","detenir","des","courriels","pour","informer","les","gens","n","est","pas","dangereux","au","contraire","ce","qui","est","mauvais","c","est","de","les","revendre","tout","ce","que","le","site","detiendrait","serait","pour","redonner","a","l","utilisateur","alexandre","l","operateur","ne","recoit","que","des","agregats","combien","d","inscrits","combien","de","departs","jamais","la","liste","regle","15","l","operateur","sans","acces","se","desinscrire","un","courriel","infolettre","desinscription","suffit","la","sortie","est","immediate","sans","justification","demandee","les","editions","quotidiennes","signees","par","sophia","sont","archivees","ici","meme","l","edition","du","jour","l","archive","l","archive","des","editions","m